From e67b22c64347fab5ab173decceebad99f94ca38b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:13:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test(kanban,cli): port class-routing tests onto the
 owner/gateway turn path [daveey]

Upstream moved card execution to the profile owner (worker argv is just
-m hermes_cli.kanban_worker_client) and builds every CLI turn's agent in the
gateway (cli._init_agent is a GatewayAgent proxy; _prepare_deferred_agent_startup
removed in 4b6a8edd6a4). The fork's class-tier, deep review/retry, provider-auto,
native-wire and paid-entry-fails-closed assertions now read owner_model_pin and
build through tui_gateway _make_agent, where the agent is actually constructed.
